# Protective Parents: "When this creature dies, create a Young Hero Role token attached to up to one target creature you control."
# Bot2's Bolt kills the Parents on turn 2. The trigger's target may not be Bot2's own Ornithopter (not "you control"), and is
# Bot1's Memnite; the Young Hero Role is attached to it. On turn 3 the Memnite (toughness 1, 3 or less) attacks: the Role puts a
# +1/+1 counter on it (CR 303.7), so it is a 2/2 and Bot2, with no blockers, takes 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Protective Parents
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island x17

